{
    "_comment": "Pequod — light Pandoc highlight theme. Crew roles map to syntax: keyword=Ahab, string=Tashtego, number=Pip, comment=Ishmael, function=Starbuck, type=Queequeg, constant=Stubb, variable=Daggoo, operator=Ishmael, import=Stubb.",
